&lt; complexType name="QueryBean "&gt;  
&lt;all&gt;  
&lt;element  name="data"  nillable="true"  type="intf: ArrayOf\_SOAP-ENC\_Array &lt;element name="ColumnList" nillable="true"  
type="intf: ArrayOf\_SOAP-ENC\_string  
&lt;/all&gt;  
&lt;/complexType&gt;  
| Element name   | Description                                  |
|----------------|----------------------------------------------|
| ColumnList     | String array that contains column names      |
| data           | 2-dimensional array that contains query data |

